window.products.push({"id":1111008,"name":"Vendstar 3000 Bulk Candy Vending Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wZUqsZmkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This vending machine is used but is clean as new. All parts have been screened and cleaned to make sure everything is in excellent working condition. I have been vending since 1995 and used just about every kind of bulk candy vending machine made. When I discovered the Vendstar 3000 I could not help but be very pleased with the simplicity and durability of this machine. It's work saving features make it a good fit for both the serious vendor or a person who wants to own and run a small personal business. The contemporary compact design has made it a successful machine for me. This machine will come with it's own set of keys. It weighs less than 14 pounds and stands approximately 48\" high. It stands on it's pedestal, has three separate interchangeable canisters that fit into a coin mechanism component.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wZUqsZmkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vendstar 3000","source_asin":"B001819GLE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001819GLE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001819GLE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
