window.products.push({"id":1111010,"name":"GiftsRDecor Indoor Tabletop Fountain Water Jars and Bamboo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bALRZhimL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A one of a type tabletop water fountain. Magnificent craftsmanship is obvious from the pictures.In this beautiful table top fountain water cascades from two Jars into a big broken Jar and then finally falling into three seperate Jars. A splendid design. Notice the bamboo and the greenery around. The colors of the rock formation are so natural.The fountain also includes 4 color changing LED lights that help to illuminate the fountain and makes the water glimmer and elegantly reflect off of surrounding surfaces.The fountain is made of poly-resin material and comes fully assembled. All our products are shipped directly by Amazon from Amazon warehouses and also available under Amazon Prime. So enjoy worry free shopping.The tabletop fountain adds the soothing sounds of splashing water to any home, patio or office setting. Clear your mind as this beautiful fountain slowly melt away tension. The calming sound of naturally flowing water provides the perfect backdrop for sleep, relaxation and concentration.QUICK TIPS:Tip #1: Read the instruction manual for operation and troubleshooting.Tip #2: Make sure the fountain pump is properly immersed in water. See the instruction manual.Tip #3: All pumps are tested for quality assurance. If you hear pump noise then it is because the pump is not properly immersed in water (try putting in more water, refer to instructional manual) or not properly placed / laying flat inside the fountain (try place adjusting the pump slowly in the fountain until pump noise goes away completely).Tip #4: Note that water pumps do not come with on/off switch.Tip #5: If water splash outside, please adjust the water flow of the water pump. Refer to the instructions manual.Tip #6: Relax, enjoy and melt away the stress!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bALRZhimL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GiftsRDecor","source_asin":"B0756LN8MF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0756LN8MF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0756LN8MF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
