window.products.push({"id":1111038,"name":"BAM The United States of America\"Fun Trip\" Scratch Off Map, Scratch Off States to Create a Visual Travel Journal of Your Adventures","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eFirKlygL._AC_.jpg","description":"New york city, los angeles orlando, washington dc, san diego, las v. Traveling is wonderful - but when you can't be on the road, it's fun to log your american adventures with this eye-catching scratch-off united states of america map poster. Created with coated, heavyweight paper to maintain color quality, states can be revealed by gently scratching the poster with a coin (similar to a lottery ticket). For added color clarity, remove any final coating debris by gently rubbing the area with an eraser. Scratch away to reveal popular travel destinations including san francisco, las vegas and new orleans. Your travel map will become a visual diary, triggering memories of special people and places throughout the USA. Shopping in new york, enjoying a show in las vegas, surfing on honolulu, experiencing disney in orlando or discovering the wonders of the grand canyon in arizona - this map will help you remember and boast to your friends and family. Then, use the map to dream about and plan your next big trip. Stores easily in rv closets or overhead storage bins. Fits a standard 40 x 30\" frame with standard matting or a standard 36 x 24\" poster frame (frame not included). Not suitable for small children. Lid contains small parts. Choking hazard. This map is intended a fun gift item and not as a definitive reference tool.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eFirKlygL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAM","source_asin":"B071GD8PK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071GD8PK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071GD8PK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
