window.products.push({"id":1111108,"name":"New Beer Bottle Caps Oxygen Absorbing Seal Silver Crown Caps for Home Brew or Crafts 144 Pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iv9LGEqVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed with a shiny silver colour, each of these beer bottle caps can be used on beer bottles that you plan on storing for years.   Each cap has plenty of grooves to ensure a strong seal over a bottle. The same grooves also make it easy for an opener to get into the cap to open it.   These beer caps are easy to pop onto any pry-off style bottle. They’ll crimp over the edge with the help of any capper and prevent oxygen from tampering with the freshness of the beer.  These can be used for your home brewing needs or you can use these for crafting a nice art design on one of these beer caps to show off your creativity in a unique way.  The plain silver top makes for easy labelling of your different batches of brews, so these caps are a perfect choice for keeping your beer fridge organised.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Iv9LGEqVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lansberg Home Brewing","source_asin":"B01E6H0S9A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E6H0S9A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E6H0S9A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
