window.products.push({"id":1111110,"name":"Melange 6-Piece 100% Melamine Bowl Set (Crackle Collection) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Bowls | Color: Red Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rtZ1S3pRL.jpg","description":"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn’t cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you’ll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we’ve taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you’re going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rtZ1S3pRL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B01LF2TPMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LF2TPMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LF2TPMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1111111,"name":"Red Wine Decanter Set 360 Rotation,Thickened Crystal-Glass-Bottle Body+Crystal Glass Stainless Steel Base, 1500ML For Wedding Gifts Wine Lovers - Silv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hQ+ER6NGL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"BEST CHOICE FOR WINE LOVERS- If you enjoy red wine or you have a limited budget for red wine, then you need a wine decanter that can have maximum contact with the wine, which not only filters the lees but also enhances the taste of the wine by softening the astringent tannins and allowing the fruit and flower aromas to come out. AMAZING SOBRIETY PLEASURE- 360°rotation, always looks like it's going to tip over and fall but it never does, giving you a wonderful experience and during the sobriety process. Meanwhile, the hand-cut minimalist carved pot wall, crystal clear, every side is art,becomes the center of conversation at the party. UNIQUE WAKING PROCESS- 1500 ml large capacity crystal glass red wine decanter with a width of 5.71 in at the maximum diameter, which increases the oxygen content in the wine; 360° rotation increases the contact surface between air and wine, so it increases the waking speed by 50% compared to ordinary wakers. STURDY PACKAGING- Each wine decanters and carafes is wrapped securely in a custom thick styrofoam box to avoid breakage in transit. In the unlikely event that you receive a broken wine aerator decanter, we will exchange it for a new one or refund you immediately. WONDERFUL GIFT- Every crystal wine decanter carafe is sure to add a sense of ceremony to any dinner table. You can give it as a gift for yourself or as a gift for anniversaries, birthdays, weddings, housewarmings, Thanksgiving, etc. They make lovely floral gifts and great gifts for wine lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hQ+ER6NGL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tobengda","source_asin":"B0BC882NZ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC882NZ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC882NZ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
