window.products.push({"id":1111259,"name":"CCWOFF Dish Drying Rack with Drainboard, 2 Tier Stainless Steel Dish Racks for Kitchen Counter, Detachable Dish Drainer with Utensil Holder, Mug Rack,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VSoxljxuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP COUNTERTOP DRY - Set has a funnel-shaped drain board which directs the dripping water flows into outlet quikly and automatically. The drainboard also includs a 360°rotational extended lip, so you can place the dish rack and drainboard set in the best position to match your kitchen counter while making sure the water run to sink efficiently to keep your countertop dry. FREE UP KITCHEN COUNTER SPACE - Detachable 2 tier dish drying rack doubles the capacity of your kitchen counter. The 2nd dish rack can be easily removed to be used in sink or put in kitchen cabinet when the dish are dry. It covers a small area (16.8*12.1*10.5”) while holds dinnerware sets twice as many as normal dishrack. BTW, the dish drainer is bigger than your imagination. Just try to find its limit. NO RUST、STURDY & LONG-LASTING - made of stainless steel with gloss nano-coating powder finsh,the dish rack effectively prevents rusting issues while offers great strength to support up to 100pounds without bending during your daily use. Super strong materials and water resistance make it incredibly durable and hold its value for long term use. You can rely on it. MULTIFUNCTIONAL & CUSTOMIZABLE - We got all essentials you need. 1 plate rack,1 utensil Holder, 1 wine glass rack, 1 cutting board holder,1 cup rack and a bonus — 3 removable mug rack to hold your bigger cup. You can switch their location or just remove some of them to create your exclusive configuration！ EASY TO ASSEMBLE & EASY TO CLEAN - No screws and tools are needed, you can easily install the drying rack for kitchen counter with your hands following the help of the installation manual. Every accessories can be detached easily. you can rinse them well after using it to keep hygienic. We highly recommend you have it as housewarming gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VSoxljxuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CCWOFF","source_asin":"B0B5QJG63Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5QJG63Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5QJG63Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
