window.products.push({"id":1111283,"name":"Bangbreak Figure 8 Posture Corrector Back and Shoulder Support Brace for Women & Men, Helps to Improve Posture, Prevent Slouching and Relieve Pain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RFcOXLJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Drink In Style: So you stumbled across our page and are currently weighing your options on if you REALLY need this mug added to your collection. Well let us give you a quick history lesson that might help you decide. Invented in 1941, by John G. Martin, the Moscow Mule is made with vodka, ginger beer, and lime juice, garnished with a slice or wedge of lime. Why the copper mug, you ask? Well, history states to market the new drink, John Martin turned to a friend with a copper factory. This friend just so happened to have too many copper mugs lying around and the rest is history. We have designed our mugs with a little bit of copper, a lot of love, and a stainless steel interior to help keep your drinks colder, longer. There really is no other way to drink a mule. :) We have also included a small recipe book and a few helpful hints with your purchase to help you get the most use out of your mug. Features: -Sixteen (16) ounce copper plated mug lined with a sleek stainless steel interior.  -Welded the perfect size for a perfect mule.  -Constructed to ensure longer lasting temperature regulation.  -Not for microwave or dishwasher use.   -FREE recipe starter kit eBook!! INSTRUCTIONS: -Rinse your mug.  -Review the FREE recipe starter kit.  -Mix some amazing cocktails.  -Drink and Enjoy!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RFcOXLJNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUIIKIY","source_asin":"B00UMETV0O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UMETV0O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UMETV0O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
