window.products.push({"id":1111380,"name":"Decorative Hand Printed Stained Glass Window Sun Catcher/Roundel in a Collie Dog and Lambs Design.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cutK8vTsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Celtic Glass Designs create significant and expressive gifts designed by Beverley Gallagher. In our beautiful part of the world, farming is very important. Cattle and sheep can be seen in many of the fields and on the hills. Farmers out and about on their tractors are a familiar sight, as are their collie dogs. Often, when we go to work along the country road we see herds of sheep in the road being encouraged along by diligent and hard-working collies. The black and white collie dog watches over two young lambs in the Cumbrian countryside with a lake and heather covered mountains in the background. The Collie Dog and Lambs Roundel is a beautifully hand painted, glass window decoration, which comes complete with a window suction cup. It is recommended to apply a smear of egg white on the back of the window suction cups to prevent them drying out in double glazed and drier window conditions. Window 'Roundels' are round glass decorations designed to hang in a window of the home. Various sizes of Roundel are produced by hand-printing directly onto the glass. The Window Art Roundels and Panels are framed with traditional stained glass lead, and hung with trace chain. Supplied in a fine burgundy gift box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cutK8vTsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GADINO","source_asin":"B00JQEU4B6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JQEU4B6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JQEU4B6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1111381,"name":"winner Eco Air Cooling Fan Portable, 7 Color Light 3 Speeds, Air Conditioner Cooler, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LuJjphMML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Air Cooling Fan, Mini Air Conditioner Aromatherapy with 7 Color LED Light 3 Speeds, Portable Personal Desk Air Cooler for Home Office Outdoor  Description: This air cooler provides you with a comfortable and cool space by providing a cool breeze of 5°C/ 9°F. It has a powerful cooling capacity. It produces instant cooling at 3 speeds. In the hot summer, this cooling fan will be your favorite gift.  Feature: 1. 4 in 1 equipment, including refrigeration, humidification, air purification and aromatization. Produce instant, faster cooling, and provide larger coverage with longer wind distance. You can switch between normal cooling mode and humidification cooling mode. 2. With 48*100mm plant fiber curtain, the thickened fiber can absorb more water and allow more evaporation. 7 kinds of LED colors light up, you can also add aromatherapy oil to enjoy. You can use the 10,000mAh power bank for 12 hours, so you can take a day trip outdoors. Improved energy saving and noise reduction functions. 3. Up to 5 feet of refreshing breeze, and a large air circulation distance can provide clarity. Uses the atomizer to push the fresh air to a new height, so you will feel the cold wind in a few seconds. 4. The air cooler adopts UV-C technology in the whole structural design, which will help to reduce the dust accumulated on the filter. Simple and easy to use, the filter can be removed and washed.  5. Compact design makes it easy to use. Easy to use, you can use it anywhere. Waterproof design, it can keep safe even if it shakes. Easy to clean, it itself is an almost maintenance-free solution that can keep the environment cool.  Specification: Color: White, Navy Blue (Optional) Power: 10W Wind Distance: 5 Feet Blow Angle: Vertical 90° Maximum Wind Speed: 80CFM (2.4-3m/s) Speed Mode: 3 Noise Level (DB): Less Than 68 Water Capacity: 500ml Illumination: 7-Color LED Package Weight: 9","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LuJjphMML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"winner Eco","source_asin":"B092W6LF6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092W6LF6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092W6LF6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
