window.products.push({"id":1111410,"name":"White Tulip Baking Cups, Extra Large, Pack of 50","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71On1A20T6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EcoBake Extra Large Tulip Cupcake Liner Paper Baking CupsEcoBake's tulip paper baking cups are perfect for baking a variety of treats, from cupcakes and muffins to souffles and more! Great for home bakers, these baking cup molds are manufactured on high-precision automated production lines, which provide a minimum size tolerance, making the molds suitable for use on automated destackers, perfect for restaurants and bakeries with higher production levels.The Only Tool for the JobEcoBake's baking cups are self-supporting and do not require metal tins for baking. Forget partially filled muffin or popover tins, you can use every last drop of batter. Their fluted petal design creates a level of presentation before icing is applied.Food Safety Specs: The vertical band is made from non-stick, grease proof, corrugated paper, approved for direct food contact. The base is made from non-stick, corrugated, micro-perforated paper, approved for direct food contact. The printing inks used can withstand high temperatures and spraying with preservatives.EcoBake Paper Baking Molds vs ALUMINIUM Pans: - Paper is biodegradable - EcoBake's baking cups can be used in microwave ovens - Permits metal detectors to be used at the end of the production line - EcoBakes paper baking pans allow faster cooking, thus saving energy - EcoBake's baking paper material increases food shelf-lifeAll EcoBake products are manufactured using recyclable and biodegradable paperThey safeguard the environment and comply with international regulations concerning direct food contact packaging.EcoBake uses carefully selected, highest quality raw materials in the manufacture of its products. Ecopack is UNI EN ISO 9001:2008 certified for Quality Management Systems and complies with European standards. It is also certified BRC (Issue 5) for Packaging and Packaging Material","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71On1A20T6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecobake","source_asin":"B01IMK5LCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IMK5LCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IMK5LCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
