window.products.push({"id":1111482,"name":"JLLOM Rotary Cheese Grater,Handheld Cheese Shredder with 3 Drum Blades,Stainless Steel Graters Manual Rotary Vegetable Slicer Nuts Grinder for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717GlMwixOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPERIOR VALUE:The rotary cheese grater kit contains 3 roller blades with different functions. It can cut food into flakes, strips or grinds according to your needs. Easy to operate, very suitable for grinding hard cheese, chocolate, nuts, peanuts, almonds and other ingredients. (Note: not applicable to soft cheese.) UNMATCHED QUALITY:The rotary cheese grater kit is made of food grade stainless steel, which is firm, durable and corrosion-resistant. The roller blade is very sharp, which can help you deal with food materials quickly and save time and energy. Integrated design, hard texture and long service life of rotary cheese grater. ERGONOMICALLY DESIGH:The long handle design and the wide operating space can prevent fingers from being cut. It can be easily operated with both left and right hands. You just need to insert the food into the hopper and turn the handle to shred or grate it. Make perfect cheese and ready to cook it! EASY TO USE: You just need to put the ingredients into the cheese shredder and turn the handle to slice, slice or grind them. Remember to use the semicircular pressing plate instead of fingers to press the ingredients, which can not only protect your hands, but also save labor. Let you operate the cheese shredder easily and safely. EASY TO CLEAN:The cheese grater with handle is an assembled structure, which is very convenient to disassemble. You can remove the drum blade for cleaning. NOTE: It is recommended to wash with hot water, because the cheese will melt in hot water, so it is difficult for the cheese to stick to the drum blade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717GlMwixOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JLLOM","source_asin":"B0BTBS5X9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTBS5X9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTBS5X9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
