window.products.push({"id":1111560,"name":"MH MYLUNE HOME Cooling Blanket for Hot Sleepers, Arc-chill Cold Throw Blanket for Sofa/Bed, Lightweight Breathable Summer Thin Blanket for Travel,Camp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wbMTPr7hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cool to Touch Effect 】: Use Japanese arc-chill cooling technology , is cool to touch with a cooling value (Q-max) of more than 0.458 (most cooling fabrics have only 0.2), which can quickly absorb body heat and cool you down in a moment of heat , the cold blanket will quickly reduce skin temperature 2 to 5°C at the moment of touching it. Surely the ideal blanket for hot sleepers, night sweats and hot flashes. Note:For the extremely coolest effect, you might use the cold blanket together with a fan or AC on. 【 DOUBLE-SIDED DESIGN & REVERSIBLE】: Double-sided design. Cooling side, made of Japanese arc-chill cooling fabric (25% PE, 75% Nylon blend), perfect for summertime. The other side is made of 100% recycled polyster (which is also one of the highly breathable, lightweight fabrics), it is abrasion resistant, quick drying as well, perfect for spring and autumn. The reversible cooling throw is for year-round use. Our cold blanket is Oeko-Tex Standard 100 certified, It is safe for adult, kids or pets. keep it as blanket in the bedroom ,a sheet replacement for the summer, or even as a Cooling throw blanket for sofa/couch. 【CROSS STICHES】: We use cross stiches to sew the 2 sides tightly together. So the 2 sides won’t be sperate,make it fit more snuggly to your body, so you won’t get tangled up when you toss and turn, it also prevent from turning into a knot when washing compared to other dual sided cooling blanket without cross stiches. The small size (51\"X67\" ) is ideal for kids, pets,or as couch /sofa throw. 【LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE & VERSATILE】: It is a lightweight/ thin blanket, Blankets using lightweight fabrics are more likely to be cooler than blankets with thicker layers . It is easy to carry and fold into small volume. (Our package comes with a carrying bag inside). Bring it with you whether you are traveling, flying, driving or going camping,going beach etc. It is definitely a portable and versatile cooling blanket. 【 EASY CARE】 Machine washable in cold wash under 30℃/86℉. (Gift Laundry bag is provided inside the package, highly recommended to use for prevent from snagging and Pilling). After washing, please hang it vertically on cloth hanger and dry it in a cool ventilated place(not under the sun). CAN'T DRY IN DRYER. Always keep it out of heat when not use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wbMTPr7hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MH MYLUNE HOME","source_asin":"B0C7GGXTNJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7GGXTNJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7GGXTNJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1111561,"name":"Simax Glass Pie Pan for Baking: Deep Round Pie Plate Dish Great For Apple, Pumpkin, Holiday Pies, etc. - Fluted Pie Holder - Oven Safe Tray - Borosili","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6101AYpxojS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT FLUTED SIDES transform a plain cake or quiche into a delicious dish with an attractive presentation. It’s a step up from standard pans and just as simple to prepare...a natural choice when you need something quick, easy and pretty. Dish features a fluted interior and smooth exterior. Get this pan today and wait for the compliments to come in! HEAT AND COLD SAFE WITH A HIGH THERMAL SHOCK RESISTANCE: Pop your pie in the oven, stick it in the fridge to cool off, and reheat it in the microwave… all without shattering the glass. Dishwasher safe for quick and easy cleanup. MADE IN EUROPE: Because quality counts, and you want your baking dish to last for years. Simax glassware does not absorb odors or flavors, and is cadmium and lead free, so you do not need to worry about nasty chemicals making their way into your food. Click “add to cart” now to experience the Simax difference for yourself. EASY COOK AND STORE. Our baking dish can withstand temperatures between 572° and -40° Fahrenheit (300°/-40° Celsius). Use it to cook your food and then place the leftovers in the fridge or freezer for convenient storage – transparent glass allows you to monitor the cooking process and easily identify leftovers. Baking dish measures 10.25” in diameter X 2.2” deep and is microwave and dishwasher safe. Cadmium and lead free. BOROSILICATE VS. SODA-LIME GLASS: Soda-lime glass, used by many of today’s most popular glass cookware manufactures, works great to prevent breakage from mechanical stress. But unlike Borosilicate glass, it is not so great for thermal shock resistance and withstanding temperature changes. That’s why Simax products are made from genuine, laboratory-grade Borosilicate glass, so you can cook and store your food without worrying about exploding dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6101AYpxojS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIMAX","source_asin":"B000VZ8Q3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VZ8Q3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VZ8Q3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
