window.products.push({"id":1111589,"name":"Jura S8 Automatic Coffee and Espresso Machine (Piano Black) with Cleaning Tablets (6-Count) and 2 Smart Filter Cartridges Bundle (4 Items)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MQLeKUnWL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"With its harmonious clean lines, the stylish Jura S8 Automatic Coffee and Espresso Machine exudes quality and precision in every way. It combines the best of the compact class with elements of the premium segment, including a hint of the GIGA. The impressive range of specialties and the stunning result in the cup satisfy even the most demanding coffee connoisseurs. The integrated 4.3-inch high-resolution color touchscreen display makes the machine incredibly simple to operate. The JURA S line creates a new segment in coffee machines: the premium mid-segment. 15 Different Specialties The stylish Jura S8 creates a full range of specialties from espresso to latte macchiato to a masterful standard of quality. The color touchscreen displays all the 15 preset specialties – you just need to touch and select your favorite beverage. The Pulse Extraction Process (PEP) ensures the optimum extraction time for short specialties and delivers a taste explosion for espresso and ristretto. Trend specialties finished with milk and milk foam are brought to perfection thanks to fine foam technology. Touchscreen Display The integrated 4.3-inch high-resolution color touchscreen display makes the machine incredibly simple to operate. A gentle touch with your fingertip on the screen, and your favorite beverage flows into the cup. It uses graphics and animations to show every step of preparation and guiding you through the process. Individual preferences can be programmed in a few easy steps, allowing you to rename, move, copy or duplicate products in no time. Bundle Includes: Jura S8 Automatic Coffee and Espresso Machine (Piano Black) Jura S8 Automatic Coffee and Espresso Machine (Piano Black) Jura 2-Phase Cleaning Tablets for Automatic Coffee Machines (6 Count) Jura 2-Phase Cleaning Tablets for Automatic Coffee Machines (6 Count) 2 x Jura CLEARYL Smart Filter Cartridges 2 x Jura CLEARYL Smart Filter Cartridges","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MQLeKUnWL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jura","source_asin":"B092RGWS7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092RGWS7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092RGWS7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
