window.products.push({"id":1111602,"name":"C.R. Gibson Treasured Plaque, Large, Never Never Never Give Up","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C9Wm0FGHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The things we treasure are the family and friends that are for sure in our lives. The Treasured Collection from Sandra Magsamen was inspired by the ideas and messages that celebrate the people and moments that give our lives purpose and joy. The collection draws inspiration from cherished and vintage jewelry. The timeless patina make this work of art a treasured piece of art in any home.C.R. Gibson has been in the business of family memories since 1898. When you want the best in party and giftware, trust CR Gibson, synonymous with quality for more than 140 years. Starting with the creation of the very first baby book in 1898, families around the world have depended on C.R. Gibson as their number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. Today you'll not only find baby books and photo albums, C.R. Gibson also brings you a wide choice of party supplies and gift ideas. Understanding the importance of design and craftsmanship, all C.R. Gibson products offer a tradition of quality in products that highlight classic styling as well as today's top fashions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C9Wm0FGHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B00GG9QIT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1111602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GG9QIT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GG9QIT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
